{"id":"79f72f51c5df5713","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-category-localization-data.md","title":"Category Localization Universal Property","display":"df-category-localization-data — Category Localization Universal Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-category-localization-data","aliases":["58-df-category-localization-data"],"display":"df-category-localization-data — Category Localization Universal Property","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-category-localization-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-category-localization-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-category-localization-data — Category Localization Universal Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md\">../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d71c15e0342b2318\" href=\"?note=d71c15e0342b2318\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,K,W,Q,E,F,G,H,\\eta,\\theta\\in V\">\\(D,K,W,Q,E,F,G,H,\\eta,\\theta\\in V\\)</span>。范畴、函子、自然变换使用既有的集合编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(Q)\">\\(Q_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(Q)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(Q)\">\\(Q_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(Q)\\)</span>；其他函子分量采用同样约定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"GQ=\\mathrm{ComposedFunctor}_S(G,Q)\">\\(GQ=\\mathrm{ComposedFunctor}_S(G,Q)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryLocalization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryLocalization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> 保留原接口；局部化函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 在定义内存在量化。局部化使用预复合函子全忠实且本质满的泛性质，因此不强迫同构模型的载体完全相同。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md\">../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}\">\\(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d71c15e0342b2318\" href=\"?note=d71c15e0342b2318\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CategoryLocalization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(D,K,W)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(K)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(D)\\land W\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}(K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Functor}_S(Q,K,D)\n\\land(\\forall w\\in W\\;\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S(Q_1(w),D))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Category}_S(E)\\to\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl(\\forall F\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,K,E)\\land(\\forall w\\in W\\;\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S(F_1(w),E))\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\exists G,\\eta\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,D,E)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S(\\eta,F,GQ,K,E))\\bigr)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall G,H,\\eta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,D,E)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(H,D,E)\n\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,GQ,HQ,K,E)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\exists!\\theta\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\theta,G,H,D,E)\n\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)\\;\\theta(Q_0(X))=\\eta(X))\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CategoryLocalization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(D,K,W)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(K)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(D)\\land W\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}(K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Functor}_S(Q,K,D)\n\\land(\\forall w\\in W\\;\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S(Q_1(w),D))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Category}_S(E)\\to\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl(\\forall F\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,K,E)\\land(\\forall w\\in W\\;\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S(F_1(w),E))\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\exists G,\\eta\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,D,E)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S(\\eta,F,GQ,K,E))\\bigr)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall G,H,\\eta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,D,E)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(H,D,E)\n\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,GQ,HQ,K,E)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\exists!\\theta\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\theta,G,H,D,E)\n\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)\\;\\theta(Q_0(X))=\\eta(X))\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>第一项泛性质使所有反转 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 的函子在自然同构意义下分解，第二项给出自然变换分解的存在唯一性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 的箭头集合，而不是对象之间或任意箭头之间的等价关系。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"d71c15e0342b2318","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Category}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}$ 取 [[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}$ 取 [[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"d71c15e0342b2318","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}$ 取 [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Functor}$ 取 [[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,K,W,Q,E,F,G,H,\\eta,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"Q_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"Q_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"GQ=\\mathrm{ComposedFunctor}_S(G,Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CategoryLocalization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CategoryLocalization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(D,K,W)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(K)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(D)\\land W\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}(K)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Functor}_S(Q,K,D)\n\\land(\\forall w\\in W\\;\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S(Q_1(w),D))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Category}_S(E)\\to\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\qquad\\bigl(\\forall F\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,K,E)\\land(\\forall w\\in W\\;\\mathrm{IsomorphismIn}_S(F_1(w),E))\\to\\\\\n&\\qquad\\quad\\exists G,\\eta\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,D,E)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S(\\eta,F,GQ,K,E))\\bigr)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall G,H,\\eta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,D,E)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(H,D,E)\n\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,GQ,HQ,K,E)\\to\\\\\n&\\qquad\\quad\\exists!\\theta\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\theta,G,H,D,E)\n\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(K)\\;\\theta(Q_0(X))=\\eta(X))\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":2947,"backlinks":[{"id":"cebafbaa76b53fc9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ChainHomotopyCategory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}$ 为二元谓词；$\\mathrm{CategoryLocalization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}$ 为三元谓词，采用 [[58-df-category-localization-data.md]] 的显式泛性质。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-250","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-category-localization-data.md|58-df-category-localization-data]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["e637becf421e4e61","2aed7ac2ed3313e0","877f1061e295cf5f","970e2b8779070da0","d71c15e0342b2318","a87b7e1119b63b2c"]}